diff --git a/CHANGES.rst b/CHANGES.rst
index 540bbe2..99c0e94 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -59,6 +59,13 @@ Unreleased
 -   If help is shown because ``no_args_is_help`` is enabled (defaults to ``True``
     for groups, ``False`` for commands), the exit code is 2 instead of 0.
     :issue:`1489` :pr:`1489`
+-   Fix a resource leak in shell completion. Contexts created while resolving
+    the arguments are now closed, so files opened for ``File`` options during
+    parsing are closed as well. :issue:`2799` :pr:`2800`
+-   Add a ``cleanup_timeout`` parameter to ``Context`` that limits the time
+    spent on cleanup when the context is closed. If the cleanup does not
+    complete within the timeout, it is abandoned and a warning is logged,
+    instead of blocking indefinitely.
 
 
 Version 8.1.8
